 :method
 "for each resource type of the AWS provider schema a generated minimal resource (required attributes and blocks; for types that need other objects the recipe in bb/floci_measure_recipes.edn); one terraform plan validates them all (a value the provider names as wrong is repaired, up to 5 rounds); the valid ones are applied in batches of 25 with real terraform apply -json against Floci (AWS_ENDPOINT_URL), then a refreshing plan and destroy; a type the run itself failed for (plugin crash in a batch) is run again in halves. supported = applied and destroyed; unsupported = Floci's answer says the call or service is not implemented (UnknownOperationException ...); unproven = anything else (invalid generated resource, needs another object, provider refused, no answer in the budget), with the first error line",
